  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "packet-tls-utils:Avoid calling ssl_hmac_init() and ssl_hmac_cleanup() in a loop",
  "description": "Instead of calling ssl_hmac_init() and ssl_hmac_cleanup() in\na loop, call ssl_hmac_reset(), to avoid creating and releasing\ncontexts. This should also fix Coverity 1450768, which\ndetects the multiple calls to ssl_hmac_final() as a double-free.",
  "state": "merged",
